					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-625327#post-1836539</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-625327/rat-s-nest-hub#post-1836539</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 20 Aug 2013 10:25:41 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>1359534</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Just some thoughts on the canon:</p> <p>The character narrating the epilogue is Bright, which by the writing of the epilogue in his particular timeline, is the last sane thing in existence.</p> <p>I've seen so far tales being posted about the chaos near the end, and desperate attempts to fix everything, and I like both of those ideas so far.</p> <p>I'm looking forward to seeing the start of the timeline being elaborated on, the Freemasons, and the great Occult Wars mentioned on the GOC website, the tipping of the first domino.</p> <p>Thanks to everyone who contributes to this!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
